  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\"><strong>-需要 Forge</strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif\">你是否因為玩 Flan 的模組或 ICBM 時，需要消耗大量火藥而感到困擾？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif\">是否厭倦了苦力怕什麼都不掉落的狀況？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif\">你的伺服器是否因為太卡而難以擊殺苦力怕並獲取火藥？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif\">沒有？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif\">那麼，這裡有一個可以合成火藥的模組。請依需求自行使用。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><strong>基本 1-1-1 配方</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><strong><img style=\"color:#19171c;display:block;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px none currentColor\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IwLKKeT.png\" alt=\"Basic 1-1-1 Recipe\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"color:#19171c;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"color:#19171c;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-